#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:25
#: c507b454b37c45fa8f7917035bf03c8c
msgid ""
"The top-level clone can use HTTPS. Nested remotes in "
"[`.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/.gitmodules) are still `git@github.com:…` (same for nested "
"`.gitmodules` in `arms_ros2_control` and `robot_descriptions`)."
msgstr ""
"顶层克隆可以用 HTTPS。[`.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/blob/main/.gitmodules) 里的嵌套远程仍是 "
"`git@github.com:…`（`arms_ros2_control` 和 `robot_descriptions` 的嵌套 "
"`.gitmodules` 同样如此）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:27
#: 15c2b68e22a54f48949f284edee5fd27
msgid "SSH remotes vs HTTPS / `gh`"
msgstr "SSH 远程 vs HTTPS / `gh`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:29
#: d1e75ad0c5134b6b95af7ed892174b03
msgid ""
"Machines without an `ssh` binary or GitHub SSH keys fail submodule fetch "
"with `error: cannot run ssh: No such file or directory`."
msgstr ""
"没有 `ssh` 可执行文件或 GitHub SSH 密钥的机器，拉取子模块会失败：`error: cannot run ssh: No such"
" file or directory`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:31
#: 8b135edc7743449781cf7c3d885627bc
msgid ""
"`git config url.https://github.com/.insteadOf git@github.com:` **alone is"
" not enough** for `git submodule update`. Nested repos read their own "
"`.gitmodules` and invoke `ssh` directly."
msgstr ""
"仅设置 `git config url.https://github.com/.insteadOf git@github.com:` "
"**不够**让 `git submodule update` 走通。嵌套仓会读自己的 `.gitmodules`，并直接调用 `ssh`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:33
#: f945045213d640a8864bfe3d8691e359
msgid ""
"On current open-deploy-ws `main`, `./init_repo.sh` rewrites GitHub `git@`"
" URLs in `.gitmodules` to HTTPS, runs `submodule sync` / `update`, then "
"restores `.gitmodules` (so the working tree is not left dirty). That path"
" runs when `ssh` is missing, when public mode has no usable key, or when "
"you pass `--https` / `OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1`. Prefer:"
msgstr ""
"当前 open-deploy-ws `main` 上的 `./init_repo.sh` 会把 `.gitmodules` 中的 GitHub "
"`git@` URL 改写成 HTTPS，执行 `submodule sync` / `update`，再还原 "
"`.gitmodules`（工作区不会留下脏改动）。在没有 `ssh`、public 模式没有可用密钥、或传入 `--https` / "
"`OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1` 时走这条路径。优先："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:35
#: a8392d9cdae445df81e7aec829b941da
msgid ""
"./init_repo.sh --public --ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source\n"
"# force HTTPS even if ssh exists:\n"
"./init_repo.sh --public --https --ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source"
msgstr ""
"./init_repo.sh --public --ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source\n"
"# force HTTPS even if ssh exists:\n"
"./init_repo.sh --public --https --ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:41
#: ca83108d20f547daa7a1e20922a6d2dc
msgid ""
"`./init_repo.sh --help` lists the rest (see also the [open-deploy-ws "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/README.EN.md)). Hosts that already have SSH keys (especially"
" for private nested modules) keep the original SSH URLs unless `--https` "
"is set."
msgstr ""
"`./init_repo.sh --help` 列出其余参数（另见 [open-deploy-ws "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/README.EN.md)）。已有 SSH 密钥的主机（尤其是 private 嵌套）保持原来的 SSH "
"URL，除非加了 `--https`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:43
#: 93fb7ce026944801ae15053e0f31f473
msgid ""
"If your checkout predates these flags (no `--https` in `./init_repo.sh "
"--help`), pull `main` or clone a fresh `open-deploy-ws`. For **Taku**, "
"switch descriptions to `feature/agilex` after init (see [Taku / "
"`feature/agilex`](#taku--featureagilex))."
msgstr ""
"若你的检出早于这些参数（`./init_repo.sh --help` 里没有 `--https`），先拉取 `main` 或重新克隆 "
"`open-deploy-ws`。**Taku** 在初始化后再把描述切到 `feature/agilex`（见 [Taku / "
"`feature/agilex`](#taku--featureagilex)）。"

